## Purpose
Package the already implemented larger icons, invitation-control repair,
consistent retry metrics and reorganized source as a new Windows patch release.
Preserve previous releases and every private or independently running setup.

## Tasks
- [x] Align package version, release notes and directly affected guides.
- [ ] Qualify the reviewed source and verify commit attribution.
- [ ] Normally push source and a new matching immutable release tag.
- [ ] Verify every exact-source hosted lane and release publication.
- [ ] Download and verify published assets against the exact manifest/checksums.
- [ ] Reconcile only this workstream's issue, Project item and durable backlink.

## Acceptance criteria
- [ ] Source and package version match the new tag and release notes.
- [ ] The release waits for every parallel qualification lane.
- [ ] The actual published archive, checksum file and manifest agree.
- [ ] Manifest source identity equals the exact tagged commit.
- [ ] Previous tags/releases/assets and all predecessor tracking are preserved.
- [ ] No private continuity, applicant values or unrelated work is published.
- [ ] No installation, independent-app control or live LinkedIn action occurs.

## Completion evidence
Version v0.2.5 is aligned in package metadata and source, with dedicated notes
and directly affected guides. Local and hosted qualification remain separate.
No tag or release has been created, and no installed application is being updated.

